TOKEN tinybird_read READ

DESCRIPTION >
Failed calls to one community model's own upstream, for its owner. Groups the
last `days` (default 7, the listing window) of 5xx by status, error code and
host, newest first, with the latest message of each group.

Fallback attempts are excluded: they ran on another owner's model, whose host
and errors are not this owner's to see. `counted` is how many of the failures
were the final answer to a caller, which is what the listing health counts; the
rest were retried and may have been rescued. `host` is the upstream hostname
Gen recorded, empty when the failure has none (non-final attempts and checks
Gen made itself). Caller identities are never returned.

NODE endpoint
SQL >
    %
    SELECT
        response_status AS status,
        error_response_code AS code,
        if(error_source = 'undefined', '', error_source) AS host,
        count() AS failures,
        countIf(is_final) AS counted,
        countIf(traffic_group = 'operations') AS from_pollinations,
        countIf(user_id = {{String(owner_user_id, required=True)}}) AS from_owner,
        max(start_time) AS last_at,
        argMax(substring(error_message, 1, 300), start_time) AS message
    FROM generation_events_classified
    WHERE start_time >= now() - interval least(greatest({{Int32(days, 7)}}, 1), 7) day
        AND resolved_model_requested = {{String(model, required=True)}}
        AND response_status >= 500
        AND NOT fallback_used
    GROUP BY status, code, host
    ORDER BY last_at DESC
    LIMIT 10

TYPE endpoint
